target/

# Deliberately NOT ignored, and this is the point of the file:
#   Cargo.lock  — committed. Groloo-Heart ignored it, so no two builds of the
#                 shipped .wasm ever provably used the same dependency graph.
#   pkg/        — the wasm-bindgen output. It is a build artifact, but it is the
#                 artifact the web shell actually loads, so it is versioned and
#                 CI re-builds it to assert byte-equality.
